"Nothing Helm runs can hang. Homebrew, the VPN list and the power settings are read by running the system's own tools, and a tool that was talkative enough about its own warnings could stop forever, taking the screen waiting for it with it." = "Nada de lo que Helm ejecuta puede colgarse. Una herramienta lo bastante verbosa en sus avisos podía detenerse para siempre y bloquear la pantalla que la esperaba.";
