"Plug-ins" = "Plug-ins";
"Point Helm at a folder and give it rules. A file that arrives is checked against them in order, and the first rule that matches is the one that runs." = "Indica una carpeta y dale reglas. Un archivo que llega se comprueba en orden, y se ejecuta la primera regla que coincide.";
