"Stop" = "Detener";
"Stop could leave an abandoned scan’s folders sitting in the basket, above the Trash button, on a screen that no longer had anything to do with them — and emptying the basket credited the space to whichever volume you’d since picked." = "Detener podía dejar las carpetas de un escaneo abandonado en la cesta, encima del botón de Papelera, en una pantalla que ya no tenía nada que ver con ellas — y vaciar la cesta acreditaba el espacio al volumen que estuviera elegido entonces.";
"Stop scan" = "Detener";
"Stop stops the disk scan. Opening a folder mid-scan used to start a second one that took over, leaving the first walking the disk with nothing able to stop it and the ring flickering between the two. And the duplicate finder’s “freed” figure now counts the copies that actually leave." = "Detener detiene el escaneo del disco, y la cifra de espacio liberado en duplicados cuenta las copias que se van.";
"Stop watching" = "Dejar de vigilar";
"Style" = "Estilo";
"Switching VPN off and back on could leave the tile and the settings page silently frozen, answering nothing, until Helm was relaunched." = "Apagar y volver a encender VPN podía dejar la ficha y la página de ajustes congeladas en silencio, sin responder, hasta reiniciar Helm.";
"Switching to another module and back no longer throws away what you were doing. The Uninstaller used to lose every tick, the whole review step, and the record of what macOS had refused, the moment you left its page; Login Items & Extensions restarted its scan — the slowest one in the app — the same way. Both remember now." = "Cambiar a otro módulo y volver ya no descarta lo que estabas haciendo. El Desinstalador solía perder cada marca, todo el paso de revisión y el registro de lo que macOS había rechazado en cuanto salías de su página; Ítems de inicio y extensiones reiniciaba su escaneo — el más lento de la app — de la misma manera. Ahora ambos recuerdan.";
